### Health check
GET http://localhost:4000/health

### Platform readiness (which credentials are present)
GET http://localhost:4000/platforms

### Validate a message without publishing
POST http://localhost:4000/validate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Check out our latest business platform and grow your online visibility. https://example.com"
}

### Publish to every configured platform
POST http://localhost:4000/posting
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Check out our latest business platform and grow your online visibility. https://example.com"
}

### Publish with an idempotency key (retrying this call will not post twice)
POST http://localhost:4000/posting
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-001

{
  "message": "Shipping our new dashboard today. https://example.com/dashboard"
}

### Validation error: more than 200 characters
POST http://localhost:4000/posting
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "This message is far too long for the API to accept and it keeps going and going and going well past the two hundred character limit so the request must be rejected with a helpful validation error and no network calls. https://example.com"
}

### Validation error: no CTA link
POST http://localhost:4000/posting
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "No link in this message"
}

### Validation error: two CTA links
POST http://localhost:4000/posting
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Two links https://example.com and https://example.org"
}

### Validation error: non-public URL
POST http://localhost:4000/posting
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Only local for now http://localhost:4000/dashboard"
}
